final_image_tex = SubResource("Resource_gl4gq")
blurb = "Depicts the actor Bandō Takesaburō I seated in a garden with blue flowers, rolling up a scroll, while a turtle is crawling up the bank towards him.

The inset depicts Fukurokuju, a god of wisdom and longevity, likely an assimilation of several Chinese deities. He is one of the Seven Lucky Gods in Japanese mythology, and was believed to be an immortal who could exist without eating food during his human incarnation.

The inset is signed Yoshijo (\"daughter of Yoshi\"), Kuniyoshi's daughter and student."
metadata/_custom_type_script = "uid://6kpsqyb2pk7a"
